# The build context of Dockerfile is the repository root. Keep VCS data and
# build, test and coverage outputs out of it. nydus/src/bin is source, so bin
# dirs are excluded by path, not by **/bin.
.git
**/target
nydus-snapshotter/bin
nydusify/nydusify
coverage
coverage-tools
.test-tmp
lcov.info
**/*.out
**/*.profraw
**/*.test
**/node_modules
